    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d412">

                <pb facs="0772" n="710" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg710"/>

                <head>No. 407.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Evarts to Dr. Aceval.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-11-13"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 13,
                        1878</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that the
                    President has taken into deliberate and mature consideration your note to this
                    Department of the <pb facs="0773" n="711" xml:id="pg711"/> 27th of March last,
                    with the accompanying documents, books, and maps, relative to the question
                    submitted to his arbitrament by the Governments of Paraguay and the Argentine
                    Confederation, in regard to the ownership of the territory on the west bank of
                    the Paraguay, between the main branch of the Pilcomayo and the Verde Rivers. The
                    conclusion which he has reached is embodied in the instrument which I have the
                    honor to inclose, and decides the question in favor of Paraguay.</p>
                <p>I avail, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>WM. M. EVARTS.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d412-a1.xml" xpointer="d412-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
